{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109947","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109947/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109947/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109947/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109947","id":3350230912,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6lIQdl","number":109947,"title":"Avoid unnecessary conversions when rendering SVG via Image when premultiplied alpha is desired.","user":{"login":"mooflu","id":693717,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MzcxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/693717?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu","html_url":"https://github.com/mooflu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","color":"b64245","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-08-25T02:55:36Z","updated_at":"2026-03-05T19:47:00Z","closed_at":"2026-03-05T19:16:48Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109947","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109947","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109947.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109947.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"This adds a `premult_alpha` parameter to `load_svg_from_buffer` and `load_svg_from_string`. \r\nSetting this to true avoids unnecessary conversions, as the underlying SVG renderer (ThorVG) internally uses premultiplied alpha.\r\n\r\nThe default of `premult_alpha = false` means ThorVG will internally convert to straight alpha during its post-render phase (`rasterUnpremultiply` via `postRender` via `canvas->draw`)\r\nSee https://github.com/thorvg/thorvg/blob/v0.15.x/src/renderer/sw_engine/tvgSwRaster.cpp#L1590\r\n\r\nBefore this change a user would have to call `Image.premultiply_alpha` in order to use `BLEND_MODE_PREMULT_ALPHA` - resulting in a double conversion.\r\n\r\nSample project with some timing comparisons:\r\n[svgpma.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21960662/svgpma.zip)\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"mooflu","id":693717,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MzcxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/693717?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu","html_url":"https://github.com/mooflu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109947/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109947/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}